<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Credit Note Approval - {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Invoice__r.KimbleOne__Account__r.Name}" recipientType="User" relatedToType="KimbleOne__CreditNote__c"><messaging:htmlEmailBody > <html> <body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f0f0f;text-align:left;"> <table width="600px" align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:20px;"> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:5px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-left-style:none; border-bottom-style:solid;border-right-style:none;"> <apex:image id="KimbleLogo" value="{!$Setup.KimbleOne__KimbleOneConfigSetting__c.KimbleOne__EmailTemplateLogoURL__c}"/></td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1em;font-size:1em;font-weight:bold;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;"> Please confirm that the following Credit Note is correct and is ready to be dispatched to the customer.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:8px;font-size:.8em;"> Your approval will result in the Invoice being passed to our Finance department for despatch.<br/>By rejecting the Credit Note it will revert to a Draft state.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;"> Follow the&nbsp;<apex:outputlink value="{!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140,FIND('.com',$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+4)+relatedTo.Id}">Link</apex:outputlink> to view this Credit Note in Kimble.</td></tr> <tr><td align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:10px;"> <table style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-collapse:collapse;"> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;" width="130px"><b>Account:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Invoice__r.KimbleOne__Account__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> {!relatedTo.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Fields.KimbleOne__CreditNoteDate__c.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> <apex:outputText value="{0, date, MMM-dd-yyyy}"> <apex:Param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__CreditNoteDate__c}" /> </apex:OutputText></td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Related Invoice:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Invoice__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr> <td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Fields.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText></td> </tr> <tr> <td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Fields.KimbleOne__TaxAmount__c.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__TaxAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText></td> </tr> <tr> <td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;" ><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Fields.KimbleOne__GrossAmount__c.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__GrossAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText></td> </tr> <apex:OutputText rendered="{!IF(relatedTo.KimbleOne__Invoice__r.KimbleOne__InvoiceContextDescription__c==null,'false','true')}"> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>Invoice Context: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Invoice__r.KimbleOne__InvoiceContextDescription__c}</td></tr> </apex:OutputText> </table> </td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;">You can approve or reject this Credit Note in Kimble. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project's owner.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;">Regards<br/>{!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature}</td></tr> </table> </body> </html></messaging:htmlEmailBody><messaging:plainTextEmailBody > Please confirm that the following Credit Note is correct and is ready to be dispatched to the customer. Your approval will result in the Invoice being passed to our Finance department for despatch. By rejecting the Credit Note it will revert to a Draft state. Account: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Invoice__r.KimbleOne__Account__r.Name} {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Label}: {!relatedTo.Name} {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Fields.KimbleOne__CreditNoteDate__c.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{0, date, MMM-dd-yyyy}"><apex:Param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__CreditNoteDate__c}" /></apex:OutputText> Related Invoice: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Invoice__r.Name} {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Fields.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText> {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Fields.KimbleOne__TaxAmount__c.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__TaxAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText> {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__CreditNote__c.Fields.KimbleOne__GrossAmount__c.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__GrossAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText> You can approve or reject this Credit Note in Kimble. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project owner. Regards {!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature}</messaging:plainTextEmailBody></messaging:emailTemplate>